[0.503, "o", "Once installed, every 'git commit' will:\r\n  1. Prompt for commit type (bug/feature/docs/refactor)\r\n  2. Call CommitCraft to generate an AI message\r\n  3. Open your editor with the AI-generated message pre-filled\r\n  4. You can edit, accept, or reject the message\r\n"]
