[0.004, "o", "Now let's commit using the git hook:\r\nThe hook will:\r\n  1. Prompt for commit type (press Enter to skip) (if interactive mode is on)\r\n  2. Generate the AI commit message\r\n  3. Open editor with the message pre-filled\r\n\r\n"]
